sparky-stereo-browser (@DEBVERSION@) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Where the browser draws its window without the graphics card (a software
    compositor), it cannot hand a page's two views to the desktop: the 3D
    Canvas camera and the flat WebXR display are off for that session, pages
    show their ordinary picture, and the window's notification bar says so
    once, with the reason the graphics layer gives. Before, the two views
    were shown squeezed side by side as one flat picture, with nothing said.

